From: DBY-W09 contributors <contributors@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: nt36523: expose three DBY-W09 refresh modes

Expose 30/60/120 Hz with one pixel clock and variable vertical front porch.
Use refresh_hz only to select the preferred mode; program the active CRTC
rate before sleep-out with the stock selector values in LP mode.
Keep owner data, power timing and the ESD recovery policy unchanged.

---

--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-novatek-nt36523.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-novatek-nt36523.c
@@ -38,7 +38,7 @@
